{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"matchingPolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials8CalendarV","text":"Calendar"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials8CalendarV14MatchingPolicyO","text":"MatchingPolicy"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:20FoundationEssentials8CalendarV14RecurrenceRuleV14matchingPolicyAC08MatchingG0Ovp","modules":[{"name":"FoundationEssentials"}],"title":"matchingPolicy","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"18.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS"},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"18.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iPadOS"},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"18.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst"},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"macOS"},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"18.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"tvOS"},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"11.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"watchOS"}],"symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"matchingPolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Calendar","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials8CalendarV","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MatchingPolicy","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials8CalendarV14MatchingPolicyO","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/MatchingPolicy"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An occurrence may not be a valid date if it falls on a leap day or a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"leap hour when there is not one. When that happens, we can choose to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ignore the occurrence (","type":"text"},{"code":".strict","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), choose a later time which has the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"same components (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".nextTimePreservingSmallerComponents"},{"text":"), or find an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"earlier time (","type":"text"},{"code":".previousTimePreservingSmallerComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For example, consider an event happening every year, starting on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"29th of February 2020. When the matching policy is set to ","type":"text"},{"code":".strict","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it yields the following recurrences:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2020-02-29","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-02-29","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"2028-02-29","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"…","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"With ","type":"text"},{"code":"matchingPolicy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of ","type":"text"},{"code":".previousTimePreservingSmallerComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"we get a result for each year:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2020-02-29","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2021-02-28","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2022-02-28","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2023-02-28","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-02-29","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Lastly, a ","type":"text"},{"code":"matchingPolicy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of ","type":"text"},{"code":".nextTimePreservingSmallerComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"moves invalid occurrences to the day after February 29:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2020-02-29","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2021-03-01","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2022-03-01"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2023-03-01"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2024-02-29"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The same logic applies for missing leap hours during daylight saving"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"time switches. For example, consider an event repeating daily, which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"starts at March 9 2024, 01:30 PST. With a "},{"code":".strict","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" matching policy,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the event repeats on the following dates, and skips a day:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-09 01:30 PST (09:30 UTC)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(on 2024-03-10, there is a missing hour between 1am and 2am)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-11 01:30 PDT (08:30 UTC)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-12 01:30 PDT (08:30 UTC)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"With ","type":"text"},{"code":"matchingPolicy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of ","type":"text"},{"code":".previousTimePreservingSmallerComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"we get a result for each day:","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-09 01:30 PST (09:30 UTC)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-10 02:30 PST (10:30 UTC)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(on 2024-03-10, there is a missing hour between 1am and 2am)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-11 01:30 PDT (08:30 UTC)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-12 01:30 PDT (08:30 UTC)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Lastly, a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"matchingPolicy"},{"text":" of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".nextTimePreservingSmallerComponents"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"moves invalid occurrences an hour forward:","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-09 01:30 PST (09:30 UTC)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-10 00:30 PST (08:30 UTC)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(on 2024-03-10, there is a missing hour between 1am and 2am)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-11 01:30 PDT (08:30 UTC)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-12 01:30 PDT (08:30 UTC)","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Default value is ","type":"text"},{"code":".nextTimePreservingSmallerComponents","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"What to do when a recurrence is not a valid date","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule\/matchingPolicy","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Working with recurrence rule properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Working-with-recurrence-rule-properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule\/calendar","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule\/frequency-swift.property","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule\/interval","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule\/end-swift.property","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule\/repeatedTimePolicy","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule\/setPositions"]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/calendar\/recurrencerule\/matchingpolicy"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://FoundationEssentials/documentation/FoundationEssentials/Calendar/MatchingPolicy":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A hint to the search algorithm to control the method used for searching for dates."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MatchingPolicy"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/